486	+// configureFocusChangedMsg forces huh's dynamic titles to re-evaluate after a
487	+// field transition. huh evaluates TitleFunc before it calls Blur/Focus while
488	+// handling NextField, so without this follow-up frame the help bar changes but
489	+// the old section keeps the active-colored question mark until another keypress.
490	+type configureFocusChangedMsg struct{}
491	+
